396
00:50:13.210 --> 00:50:16.000
A woman. young. dark hair.

397
00:50:19.110 --> 00:50:20.480
She's in.

398
00:50:46.570 --> 00:50:47.840
Who are you?

399
00:50:49.540 --> 00:50:51.010
Shit.

400
