500
01:00:47.470 --> 01:00:49.630
You know more than me. I assure you.

501
01:00:51.440 --> 01:00:52.840
May I be "frank"?

502
01:00:54.910 --> 01:00:55.900
Mm-hmm.

503
01:00:57.280 --> 01:00:58.680
