521
01:02:02.180 --> 01:02:05.380
TTI custom Benelli M2 21-inch fin grip.

522
01:02:05.480 --> 01:02:09.220
Oversized charging handle.

523
01:02:05.480 --> 01:02:09.220
oversized bolt release.

524
01:02:09.320 --> 01:02:11.980
This will take a bear's head off. Easily.

525
01:02:15.030 --> 01:02:17.050
Now. this is a personal favorite of mine.

526
01:02:17.160 --> 01:02:19.190
- This...

527
01:02:28.740 --> 01:02:31.230
Ah! Fuck! Bastards! Fuck!

528
01:05:24.420 --> 01:05:25.580
Motherfuckers.

529
01:05:30.090 --> 01:05:31.080
All right...

530
01:05:31.960 --> 01:05:33.450
