535
01:05:45.070 --> 01:05:46.260
That's bad math.

536
01:05:46.940 --> 01:05:51.240
However. whispers suggest they've been

537
01:05:46.940 --> 01:05:51.240
known to gather somewhere in these peaks.

538
01:05:51.310 --> 01:05:54.250
deep in the mountains

539
01:05:51.310 --> 01:05:54.250
past Abersee and Feldkirk.

540
01:05:55.380 --> 01:05:56.370
It's not much.

541
01:05:56.450 --> 01:05:58.140
It's more than I had.

542
01:05:58.820 --> 01:05:59.880
Thank you.

543
01:06:02.950 --> 01:06:04.290
